<title>USA: Food Concepts in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Food Concepts in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>COCONUT CREEK, Fla. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Concepts Inc said Friday it is negotiating the acquisition of a Florida-based coffee roaster company.</p>
<p>Food Concepts said acquiring the company would add more than $1 million in revenues annually and would increase Food Concept's roasting capacity three-fold.</p>
<p>The company said it would provide more details Monday.</p>
</text>
